#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""One-command transport input pipeline for H2RES.

Runs the existing geospatial NUTS3 allocation and then aggregates every
passenger/freight process into model zones.  It writes both the compact
technology table and a model-ready ``transport_all`` sheet matching the
legacy H2RES workbook layout.
"""

